<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
  <title>UK Pay Calculator · 2026/27</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #10243b;
      --muted: #5b6b7c;
      --navy: #12385b;
      --navy-deep: #0a2945;
      --teal: #087f75;
      --teal-soft: #dff5f1;
      --blue-soft: #e8f1f8;
      --gold: #f0b429;
      --gold-soft: #fff6d8;
      --red: #b42318;
      --red-soft: #fff0ed;
      --green: #067647;
      --green-soft: #e8f7ef;
      --paper: #ffffff;
      --canvas: #f4f7f9;
      --line: #d6e0e7;
      --shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(18, 56, 91, 0.09);
      --radius: 18px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-width: 320px;
      color: var(--ink);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 8% -8%, rgba(8, 127, 117, 0.13), transparent 32rem),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #f9fbfc 0, var(--canvas) 34rem);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    button, input, select { font: inherit; }

    button, select, input { min-height: 42px; }

    button { cursor: pointer; }

    button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, a:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid rgba(240, 180, 41, 0.75);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    a { color: var(--teal); }

    .shell {
      width: min(1440px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 30px clamp(22px, 4vw, 50px);
      border-radius: 24px;
      color: white;
      background:
        linear-gradient(118deg, rgba(18, 56, 91, 0.98), rgba(10, 41, 69, 0.96)),
        var(--navy);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: auto -80px -130px auto;
      width: 330px;
      height: 330px;
      border: 44px solid rgba(33, 211, 179, 0.12);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: #9be9db;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }

    h1 {
      max-width: 820px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.1rem);
      line-height: 1.02;
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #d9e7f1;
      font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1.6vw, 1.15rem);
    }

    .privacy-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.19);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #eafffa;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .privacy-pill svg { flex: 0 0 auto; }

    .layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(340px, 0.72fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 22px 0;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .stack { display: grid; gap: 20px; }

    .card {
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(18, 56, 91, 0.1);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--paper);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(18, 56, 91, 0.055);
    }

    .card-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 20px 22px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .card-head h2 {
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-size: 1.18rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }

    .card-head p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    .card-body { padding: 20px 22px 22px; }

    .section-label {
      margin: 22px 0 10px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: 0.11em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .section-label:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

    .field-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .field { min-width: 0; }

    .field.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }

    label {
      display: block;
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      color: #29445e;
      font-size: 0.83rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .help {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.73rem;
    }

    input, select {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid #bdcbd6;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: #fff;
      padding: 9px 11px;
      transition: border-color 120ms ease, box-shadow 120ms ease;
    }

    input:hover, select:hover { border-color: #8fa5b6; }

    input[aria-invalid="true"], select[aria-invalid="true"] {
      border-color: var(--red);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(180, 35, 24, 0.1);
    }

    .input-prefix {
      position: relative;
    }

    .input-prefix::before {
      content: "£";
      position: absolute;
      left: 11px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      color: #5b6b7c;
      font-weight: 700;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .input-prefix input { padding-left: 27px; }

    .mini-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .mini-stat {
      padding: 12px 13px;
      border: 1px solid #d9e6ed;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #f8fbfc;
    }

    .mini-stat span {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .mini-stat strong {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 3px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .adjustments { display: grid; gap: 10px; }

    .adjustment-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(125px, 1fr) minmax(110px, 0.75fr) minmax(185px, 1.25fr);
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: end;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: #fbfcfd;
    }

    .adjustment-name {
      align-self: center;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .adjustment-name small {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 2px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .entry-top {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: end;
    }

    .status-chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 42px;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #5b4910;
      background: var(--gold-soft);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .status-chip.saved {
      color: var(--green);
      background: var(--green-soft);
    }

    .entry-table {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .entry-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(135px, 1.25fr) minmax(85px, 0.65fr) minmax(100px, 0.75fr) minmax(90px, 0.75fr);
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .entry-row.header {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .entry-row .name { font-size: 0.86rem; font-weight: 700; }

    .entry-row .calc {
      text-align: right;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .entry-row input { text-align: right; }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .btn {
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 11px;
      padding: 9px 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      transition: transform 100ms ease, background 120ms ease, border-color 120ms ease;
    }

    .btn:active { transform: translateY(1px); }

    .btn-primary {
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--teal);
      box-shadow: 0 7px 14px rgba(8, 127, 117, 0.18);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover { background: #066f67; }

    .btn-secondary {
      color: var(--navy);
      border-color: #b9cad6;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover { background: #f2f7fa; }

    .btn-danger {
      color: var(--red);
      border-color: #f0b9b2;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .btn-danger:hover { background: var(--red-soft); }

    .validation {
      display: none;
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border: 1px solid #f0b9b2;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: var(--red);
      background: var(--red-soft);
      font-size: 0.83rem;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .validation.show { display: block; }

    .result-card {
      position: sticky;
      top: 16px;
    }

    .take-home {
      padding: 24px 22px;
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--navy), var(--navy-deep));
    }

    .take-home span {
      display: block;
      color: #9be9db;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .take-home strong {
      display: block;
      margin: 3px 0 6px;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    .take-home p { margin: 0; color: #c8d8e5; font-size: 0.8rem; }

    .breakdown { padding: 10px 22px 20px; }

    .break-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e9ee;
      font-size: 0.87rem;
    }

    .break-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }

    .break-row span { color: var(--muted); }

    .break-row strong { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

    .break-row.emphasis { color: var(--navy); font-size: 0.93rem; }

    .break-row.emphasis span { color: var(--navy); font-weight: 800; }

    .assumption-note {
      margin: 0 22px 22px;
      padding: 11px 12px;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
      color: #594a17;
      background: var(--gold-soft);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }

    .wide-card { margin: 0 0 22px; }

    .toolbar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .toolbar .btn { min-height: 38px; padding: 7px 11px; font-size: 0.8rem; }

    .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 1060px;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    th, td {
      padding: 11px 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      text-align: right;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    th:first-child, td:first-child { padding-left: 22px; text-align: left; }

    th:last-child, td:last-child { padding-right: 22px; }

    thead th {
      color: #29445e;
      background: var(--blue-soft);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.035em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    tbody tr:hover { background: #f8fbfc; }

    tbody tr.selected { background: #eef9f7; }

    tbody td.month-cell { font-weight: 850; }

    .empty { color: #9aa8b3; }

    .row-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .row-btn {
      min-height: 30px;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border: 1px solid #bfd0db;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: #fff;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .row-btn.delete { color: var(--red); border-color: #e8c2bd; }

    tfoot td {
      color: #fff;
      border: 0;
      background: var(--navy);
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .log-foot {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 13px 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.76rem;
    }

    details {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 15px 18px;
      color: var(--navy);
      font-weight: 850;
    }

    .details-copy {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 0 18px 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .details-copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .source-list { margin: 6px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; }

    footer {
      padding: 4px 0 28px;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }

    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      z-index: 20;
      right: 20px;
      bottom: 20px;
      max-width: min(390px, calc(100% - 40px));
      padding: 12px 15px;
      border-radius: 11px;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--navy-deep);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(10, 41, 69, 0.28);
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(14px);
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    .toast.error { background: var(--red); }

    .sr-only {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      padding: 0;
      margin: -1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
      white-space: nowrap;
      border: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .result-card { position: static; }
      .result-card .card-body { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .take-home { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .shell { width: min(100% - 20px, 1440px); }
      .hero { margin-top: 10px; padding: 24px 20px; border-radius: 18px; }
      .layout { gap: 14px; margin-top: 14px; }
      .stack { gap: 14px; }
      .card-head { display: block; padding: 18px 16px 14px; }
      .card-body { padding: 17px 16px 18px; }
      .field-grid, .details-copy { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .adjustment-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .adjustment-name { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
      .entry-row { grid-template-columns: minmax(110px, 1.1fr) minmax(70px, 0.7fr) minmax(82px, 0.8fr); }
      .entry-row > :nth-child(4) { display: none; }
      .result-card .card-body { display: block; }
      .breakdown { padding-inline: 16px; }
      .assumption-note { margin-inline: 16px; }
      .log-foot { display: block; padding-inline: 16px; }
      .toolbar { margin-top: 12px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 470px) {
      .adjustment-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .adjustment-name { grid-column: auto; }
      .entry-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .status-chip { justify-self: start; }
      .actions .btn { flex: 1 1 100%; }
      .mini-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media print {
      body { background: #fff; }
      .hero { color: #000; background: #fff; box-shadow: none; border: 1px solid #bbb; }
      .hero-copy, .privacy-pill, .actions, .toolbar, .row-actions, details, footer { display: none !important; }
      .layout { display: block; }
      .card { break-inside: avoid; box-shadow: none; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      .result-card { position: static; }
      .take-home { color: #000; background: #fff; }
      .take-home span, .take-home p { color: #333; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="hero shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">2026/27 · UK employment estimate</p>
    <h1>Your pay, properly accounted for.</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">Calculate monthly pay, UK Income Tax, employee National Insurance, Select points, your car payment and pension salary sacrifice—then save each payroll month to the 2026/27 tax-year log with one click.</p>
    <div class="privacy-pill" title="This file makes no network requests">
      <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2 4.5 5v6.2c0 5.1 3.2 9.7 7.5 10.8 4.3-1.1 7.5-5.7 7.5-10.8V5L12 2Zm0 4.2a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v1.2h.7c.4 0 .8.4.8.8v5.1c0 .5-.4.8-.8.8H8.3a.8.8 0 0 1-.8-.8v-5.1c0-.4.4-.8.8-.8H9V9.2a3 3 0 0 1 3-3Zm0 1.5c-.8 0-1.5.7-1.5 1.5v1.2h3V9.2c0-.8-.7-1.5-1.5-1.5Z"/></svg>
      Private by design · saved only in this browser
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="shell">
    <div class="layout">
      <div class="stack">
        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="profile-title">
          <div class="card-head">
            <div>
              <h2 id="profile-title">Pay profile &amp; recurring items</h2>
              <p>Set these once. They are remembered on this device.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="section-label">Base pay</p>
            <div class="field-grid">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="annualSalary">Annual gross salary</label>
                <div class="input-prefix"><input id="annualSalary" data-profile data-recalc type="number" min="0" max="10000000" step="0.01" value="45842.49"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="taxRegion">Income Tax region</label>
                <select id="taxRegion" data-profile data-recalc>
                  <option value="ruk">England, Wales or Northern Ireland</option>
                  <option value="scotland">Scotland</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="hoursPerWeek">Contracted hours per week</label>
                <input id="hoursPerWeek" data-profile data-recalc type="number" min="0.01" max="168" step="0.1" value="37.5">
              </div>
              <div class="field">
                <label for="weeksPerYear">Weeks per year</label>
                <input id="weeksPerYear" data-profile data-recalc type="number" min="0.01" max="53" step="0.01" value="52">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mini-stats" aria-live="polite">
              <div class="mini-stat"><span>Basic monthly pay</span><strong id="basicMonthlyDisplay">£0.00</strong></div>
              <div class="mini-stat"><span>Basic hourly rate</span><strong id="hourlyRateDisplay">£0.00</strong></div>
            </div>

            <p class="section-label">Recurring points &amp; deductions</p>
            <div class="adjustments">
              <div class="adjustment-row">
                <div class="adjustment-name">Select points cash<small>Paid each month</small></div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="pointsAmount">Select cash monthly amount</label>
                  <div class="input-prefix"><input id="pointsAmount" data-profile data-recalc type="number" min="0" max="100000" step="0.01" value="254.16"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="pointsTreatment">Select cash tax treatment</label>
                  <select id="pointsTreatment" data-profile data-recalc class="treatment-select"></select>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="adjustment-row">
                <div class="adjustment-name">Select Car<small>Shown as an earning</small></div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="carAmount">Select Car monthly earning</label>
                  <div class="input-prefix"><input id="carAmount" data-profile data-recalc type="number" min="0" max="100000" step="0.01" value="516.76"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="carTreatment">Select Car tax treatment</label>
                  <select id="carTreatment" data-profile data-recalc class="treatment-select"></select>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="adjustment-row">
                <div class="adjustment-name">Car Lease GB<small>Shown as a deduction</small></div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="carLeaseAmount">Car Lease monthly deduction</label>
                  <div class="input-prefix"><input id="carLeaseAmount" data-profile data-recalc type="number" min="0" max="100000" step="0.01" value="516.76"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="carLeaseTreatment">Car Lease tax treatment</label>
                  <select id="carLeaseTreatment" data-profile data-recalc class="treatment-select"></select>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="adjustment-row">
                <div class="adjustment-name">Pension<small>Salary sacrifice</small></div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="pensionAmount">Pension monthly amount</label>
                  <div class="input-prefix"><input id="pensionAmount" data-profile data-recalc type="number" min="0" max="100000" step="0.01" value="191.01"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="pensionTreatment">Pension tax treatment</label>
                  <select id="pensionTreatment" data-profile data-recalc class="treatment-select"></select>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="help">Your July payslip confirms that Select Positive and Select Car are taxable/NI-able earnings, Car Lease GB is deducted afterwards, and the pension is salary sacrifice.</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="month-title">
          <div class="card-head">
            <div>
              <h2 id="month-title">This month</h2>
              <p>Enter variable shifts and overtime, then save the snapshot.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="entry-top">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="monthSelect">2026/27 tax-year period (1 = April, 12 = March)</label>
